{
 "id": "fox-escape-techchase",
 "name": "Escape the tech chase",
 "part": "defense",
 "characters": [
  "fox"
 ],
 "goal": "Tech a throw at the floor and get out before the cover lands",
 "why": "A throw at the floor leaves {char} in hitstun until he lands: he techs or lies there, and the opponent covers what it sees. It reacts, so the same tech twice is read. Varied techs and an action on the first free frame are the way out.",
 "switch": "success",
 "reset": {
  "after": "quiet",
  "seconds": 1
 },
 "tutorial": {
  "what": "Press L or R as {char} comes down to tech: in place, or rolling with the stick held left or right. Act on the first frame after it.",
  "expect": "Each throw is judged when the opponent's cover lands, or once {char} has stayed untouched after the tech. The opponent sees the tech about 24 frames after it starts.",
  "example": [
   {
    "press": "R",
    "frame": "TR",
    "hold": 3,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     -1,
     0
    ],
    "frame": "TR",
    "hold": 6,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "press": "jump",
    "frame": 1,
    "hold": 12,
    "from": {
     "leaves": "tech"
    }
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     -1,
     0
    ],
    "frame": 1,
    "hold": 30,
    "from": {
     "leaves": "tech"
    }
   }
  ],
  "marks": {
   "1": "Frame 1: the throw starts",
   "TR": "Frame {TR}: R, and the stick away",
   "FLOOR": "Frame {FLOOR}: the floor. A tech"
  },
  "lessons": [
   {
    "title": "The tech",
    "text": [
     "Thrown at the floor, {char} is in hitstun until he lands. L or R pressed in the 20 frames before the floor is a tech: back on his feet after 26 frames, or 40 with a roll, the stick held left or right.",
     "No press, or one too early, is a missed tech: {char} bounces and lies there, open for longer."
    ],
    "show": {
     "example": {
      "inputs": [
       {
        "press": "R",
        "frame": "TR",
        "hold": 3,
        "from": "start"
       }
      ],
      "marks": {
       "1": "Frame 1: the throw starts",
       "TR": "Frame {TR}: R",
       "FLOOR": "Frame {FLOOR}: the floor. A tech in place"
      },
      "cues": [
       {
        "frames": [
         "T0",
         "T1"
        ],
        "words": "L or R now: a tech",
        "kind": "go"
       },
       {
        "frames": [
         "FLOOR",
         "FI-1"
        ],
        "words": "Tech: {char} cannot act",
        "kind": "info"
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "title": "The chase",
    "text": [
     "The opponent waits to see where {char} goes and covers it with a grab or an attack. It sees a tech a fraction of a second after it starts, and it remembers: the same tech again is covered before it is seen.",
     "Vary it: in place, toward the opponent, away, and now and then no tech at all."
    ],
    "show": {
     "example": {
      "inputs": [
       {
        "press": "R",
        "frame": "TR",
        "hold": 3,
        "from": "start"
       },
       {
        "stick": [
         -1,
         0
        ],
        "frame": "TR",
        "hold": 6,
        "from": "start"
       }
      ],
      "marks": {
       "1": "Frame 1: the throw starts",
       "TR": "Frame {TR}: R, and the stick away",
       "FLOOR": "Frame {FLOOR}: the floor. A tech"
      },
      "cues": [
       {
        "frames": [
         "T0",
         "T1"
        ],
        "words": "L or R, the stick away",
        "kind": "go"
       },
       {
        "frames": [
         "FLOOR",
         "FR-1"
        ],
        "words": "A tech away: the roll",
        "kind": "info"
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "title": "The first free frame",
    "text": [
     "A tech in place ends after 26 frames, a roll after 40. A cover that comes a few frames late still lands on a {char} who stands there.",
     "Act on the first frame {char} can: a jump away, a spot dodge, a roll, a shine. The opponent's late answers then miss."
    ],
    "show": {
